233
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,680
what do you think Shido would do?

234
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,680
Shido would never give up.

235
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,680
He wouldn't hesitate for a moment.

236
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:27,680
I know he'd do whatever it took to save Touka.

237
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:30,680
Yoshino's right, and he'd pull it off, too.

238
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:34,680
That idiot would stare death square in the face without thinking of himself for a second.

239
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,680
He did it before, when he saved me and Yuzuru.

240
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:39,680
Agreement. There must be something wrong with him.

241
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:44,680
I'm certain he would do anything for Touka, no matter what he might be forced to sacrifice.

242
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:49,680
I will bring Touka back, no matter what happens or what I have to do!

243
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:56,680
No way! I won't accept it!

244
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:59,680
What are you talking about? Touka's been kidnapped!

245
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:04,680
And you told me that D.E.M. was a dangerous organization trying to kill off all spirits!

246
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:07,680
Exactly! They're extremely dangerous!

247
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:12,680
Excuse me for trying to keep my foreign brother from infiltrating a freaking lion's den!

248
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:15,680
And by the way, your life is just as important as the people you're protecting!

249
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,680
Are you suggesting I just leave Touka?

250
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:19,680
We need time to properly prepare!

251
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:23,680
That'll take too long! Kurumi is out there stalling the wizards for us right now!

252
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:29,680
We won't have another chance like this! Trust me! I know I can save her, I just need more time!

253
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,680
Please!

254
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:35,680
Alright, fine! Not like you'd listen if I tried to stop you anyway!

255
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:38,680
Thanks, I suppose you know me too well, Kotari.

256
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:43,680
I should hope so, I've been your sister for over a decade now, jerk.

257
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:47,680
After you've made it inside the building, they'll most likely jam all communications.

258
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:50,680
The only thing the Frexinus can do is provide support on the outside.

259
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:53,680
That will be more than enough. Thanks, Kotari.

260
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:58,680
Seriously, the things we little sisters have to deal with because of big brothers, you never listen, right, Mom?

261
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:04,680
But to be fair, I would also never accept having a weakling big brother who could turn tail and run.

262
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,680
That's pathetic.

263
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:08,680
If you're going to go through with it, I won't allow you to half-ass it.

264
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:14,680
I won't consider it a success until Touka is saved and you and Mana are back on board the Frexinus.

265
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,680
Deal.

266
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,680
Now, it's time.

267
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,680
It's time.

268
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,680
Let's begin our date!

269
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:26,680
No, Origami, you can't! Please stop!

270
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,680
Let me go. If Shido is on the battlefield, then I must help him.

271
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:34,680
That's impossible! Don't you know that your ID has been totally frozen?

272
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:38,680
You aren't even allowed to use the wiring suits, much less the CR units!

273
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:43,680
Then I'll just have to use conventional armament. I should be able to find a rifle somewhere on the base.

274
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:50,680
Are you crazy? You think you can enter a battlefield of wizards and spirits without your own territory? And on top of all of that!

275
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:56,680
Shido was nightmares accomplice in attacking DEM Industries. He's become the AST's enemy!

276
00:17:56,680 --> 00:18:09,680
Don't you understand? That's exactly why I have to go. I've lost everything else in my life. He's the only thing I can rely on now. If he dies, so will part of me. I'll no longer be myself anymore. You have to let me go.

277
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:13,680
What if I told you I would commit suicide if you left this building?

278
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:19,680
I'm confident you would never do such a thing. I know you know how sad I would be if you did.

279
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:37,680
But this isn't fair. I'm a little bit jealous of him. Because it seems as if you would do anything for him. There's one thing. I just thought of it. But I don't know if you can use it or not.

280
00:18:49,680 --> 00:19:03,680
Time to move, brother. All right. I guess now is as good a time as any. But with such a large facility, it would be nice to at least know which floor Toka is on.

281
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:10,680
If they have Toka confined, it is probably in their facility to quarantine spirits. Like the one we have on Fraxinus.

282
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:20,680
Are you okay? Yeah, yeah. I'm fine. Don't you worry.

283
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:27,680
Wait, isn't that... White Licorice?

284
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:39,680
You sure know your hardware. But this one is a little bit different. It's the sister unit to White Licorice, which was made for testing. DW029R. Scarlet Licorice.

285
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,680
Oh, no!

286
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,680
Mana!

287
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:51,680
Matt?

288
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:54,680
Shido, it's too dangerous. Don't move on your own. Wait for Mana.

289
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:59,680
But the defense is getting stronger every minute. And if I'm outside, I might get in Mana's way.

290
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:03,680
That is actually a new point. Wait, Shido!

291
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,680
Shido!

292
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:13,680
There's an intruder!

293
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:15,680
Oh, who goes there? Where did you come from?

294
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:18,680
Stop! Stop or I'll shoot!

295
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,680
Go already, Shido!

296
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,680
Damn it! I can't let it end here like this!

297
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:31,680
Toka! Toka! Toka!

298
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,680
I need you!

299
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:35,680
Huh?

300
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:38,680
Huh?

301
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,680
An angel?

302
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:54,680
Oh, yeah. About time. Let's go and save your master. Agreed?

303
00:20:54,680 --> 00:21:07,680
You summoned Sandalfaun. You brought forth its power with your desires, Shido. You see? It answered your call and only you have the power to command it now.

304
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:08,680
No!

305
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:28,680
Get out of my way, you bastard!

306
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,680
You bastard!

307
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,680
I'll save you!

308
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,680
Toka!

309
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:54,680
Toka!

310
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:59,680
Miaki

311
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,680
You

312
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:06,700
Or

313
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:36,680
Sous-titrage ST' 501

314
00:22:36,700 --> 00:23:06,680
Thank you.

315
00:23:06,700 --> 00:23:36,680
Thank you.

316
00:23:36,700 --> 00:24:06,680
Thank you.

